          ":answer-field/key": "$R = \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} & 0 \\\\ -3 & \\sqrt{3} & -0.1 & -3 \\\\ 7 & 4 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$",
