      ":question/problem": "Which of the following is a $4\\times 4$ matrix?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- The matrix $L$ has $3$ rows and $4$ columns. So, its dimensions are $3\\times 4.$ $\\,\\times$\n\n- The matrix $M$ has $4$ rows and $4$ columns. So, its dimensions are $4\\times 4.$ $\\,\\checkmark$\n\n- The matrix $N$ has $4$ rows and $4$ columns. So, its dimensions are $4\\times 4.$ $\\,\\checkmark$\n\nTherefore, only $M$ and $N$ are $4\\times 4$ matrices.",
