      ":question/problem": "Which of the following is a $1\\times 2$ matrix?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- The matrix $L$ has $1$ row and $2$ columns. So, its dimensions are $1\\times 2.$ $\\,\\checkmark$\n\n- The matrix $M$ has $1$ row and $2$ columns. So, its dimensions are $1\\times 2.$ $\\,\\checkmark$\n\n- The matrix $N$ has $2$ rows and $1$ column. So, its dimensions are $2\\times 1.$ $\\,\\times$\n\nTherefore, only $L$ and $M$ are $1\\times 2$ matrices.",
